---

## 📝 Notes

### Architecture Decisions

- Use `SuggestModal` instead of custom modal for native keyboard navigation
- `SearchEngine` uses `cachedRead()` for performance
- QueryParser is stateless and pure (easy to test)

### Known Issues

- prepareQuery is not public in Obsidian API → using simple string matching
- Content search can be slow on large vaults (> 1000 files)
- Tag comparison is case-sensitive (might want case-insensitive)

### Future Considerations

- Evaluate using Web Workers for async search
- Consider caching results for repeated queries
- Possible integration with external plugins (Dataview, Tasks, etc.)
